    {
      "source": "Doctors of Running",
      "priority": 3,
      "url": "https://www.doctorsofrunning.com/2025/08/adidas-adizero-takumi-sen-11-review-2025.html",
      "type": "qualitative",
      "keyFindings": [
        "Cushioning: The new Lightstrike Pro is noticeably softer and more protective than prior versions, with smooth heel transitions and enough impact protection for short-to-moderate races/workouts while keeping a lively forefoot feel.",
        "Responsiveness: Energy return is a major strength; the midsole feels bouncy with clear pop, and the glass-fiber Energy Rods 2.0 add a snappy toe-off that bends and rebounds at faster paces.",
        "Stability: Forefoot stability is good and the shoe is somewhat stiff, but overall stability is weaker in the heel/midfoot due to a softer platform, no heel counter, and mild heel slippage for some runners.",
        "Durability: Durability is above average for a racer; the Lighttraction GCPU outsole showed no visible wear after about 30 hard miles, and the midsole was reported to be holding up very well."
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "Road Trail Run",
      "priority": 4,
      "url": "https://www.roadtrailrun.com/2025/08/adidas-adizero-takumi-sen-11-review-5.html",
      "type": "qualitative",
      "keyFindings": [
        "Cushioning: The midsole is noticeably softer and more cushioned/forgiving than the prior version, with a livelier feel but a somewhat mushy sensation at harder paces.",
        "Responsiveness: Energy return feels fun and bouncy, but race-pace snappiness is down versus TS10, with slower transitions, longer ground contact, and less sharp pop for quick turnover.",
        "Stability: Softer foam reduces underfoot stability at fast efforts; foot containment is slightly diminished, and the narrow heel/waist makes control less confidence-inspiring (especially for heel strikers), though lockdown remains adequate.",
        "Durability: The outsole has very generous coverage and a grippy gum-like/Continental rubber setup that protects most of the foam, indicating strong outsole durability, but no long-term wear data is reported."
      ]
    }
  ],
